r style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><ruby>表紙<rt>ひょうし</rt></ruby>・<ruby>巻頭<rt>かんとう</rt></ruby>を<ruby>務<rt>つと</rt></ruby>めさせていただきました</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>で<ruby>掲載<rt>けいさい</rt></ruby>していただくのが3<ruby>度目<rt>どめ</rt></ruby>となります</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;