style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><div><img src=\"/images/blogs/watanabe.rina/2024-10-17/57768_2.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br><br><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><div><img src=\"/images/blogs/watanabe.rina/2024-10-17/57768_3.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><div>　</div><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><ruby>約<rt>やく</rt></ruby>1<ruby>年<rt>ねん</rt></ruby>ぶりだったのですが、</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><ruby>週刊<rt>しゅうかん</rt></ruby><ruby>少年<rt>しょうねん</rt></ruby>チャンピオン 46<ruby>号<rt>ごう</rt></ruby>&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">と<ruby>縁<rt>えん</rt></ruby>を<ruby>感<rt>かん</rt></ruby>じる<ruby>数字<rt>すうじ</rt></ruby>で<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しかったです🫧</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">スタッフの<ruby>皆様<rt>みなさま</rt></ruby>と<ruby>久<rt>ひさ</rt></ruby>しぶりにお<ruby>会<rt>あ</rt></ruby>いできて、<ruby>前回<rt>ぜんかい</rt></ruby>の<ruby>撮影<rt>さつえい</rt></ruby>の<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>のお<ruby>話<rt>はなし</rt></ruby>などして、<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しい<ruby>思い出<rt>おもいで</rt></ruby>が<ruby>蘇<rt>よみがえ</rt></ruby>りました</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>もとても<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しかったです^^</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><ruby>週刊<rt>しゅうかん</rt></ruby><ruby>少年<rt>しょうねん</rt></ruby>チャンピオン 46<ruby>号<rt>ごう</rt></ruby>をぜひお<ruby>手<rt>て</rt></ruby>に<ruby>取<rt>と</rt></ruby>っていただけると<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいです。&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br><br><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">それでは</span></div><div style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(255,255,255)\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spac